 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "buyPrices and sellPrices are the initial resting orders. orders lists incoming orders [side, price] with side \"buy\" or \"sell\", processed in order. An incoming buy matches the lowest resting sell with price <= its price; an incoming sell matches the highest resting buy with price >= its price. A matched resting order is removed; an unmatched incoming order rests on its side. Return, per incoming order, the price of the resting order it matched, or -1 when it rested.",
  "provenance": [
   {
